  "body": "(this issue was the result of a PING privacy review: w3cping/privacy-request#47)\r\n\r\nSection [4.6.5 Downloading resources](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#downloading-resources) references a \"initiator browsing context\" and a \"instantiator browsing context\".  I wasn't able to find a definition for these terms, either in HTML or other related specs.\r\n\r\nI'm 99% sure I can guess what the \"initiator browsing context\", but slightly less sure I could confidently and unambiguously define what the \"instantiator browsing context\" is (say, 85% ha).  \r\n\r\nIf this should be clear to the reader by some context im missing, please feel free to close out this issue.  But otherwise, i suggest concretely defining these terms somewhere",
